msgstr "Email address"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:15 templates/accounts/profile.html:13
msgid "Rôles"
msgstr "Roles"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:20
msgid "Compte confirmé"
msgstr "Confirmed account"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:20
msgid ""
"Nouveau compte : contributions limitées jusqu’à une première contribution "
"validée"
msgstr "New account: contributions are limited until a first contribution is validated"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:26
msgid "Enregistrer"
msgstr "Save"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:29
msgid "Voir ma page publique"
msgstr "View my public page"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:30 templates/accounts/password_change.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_change.html:8
msgid "Changer de mot de passe"
msgstr "Change password"

#: templates/accounts/account.html:31 templates/accounts/delete.html:4
#: templates/accounts/delete.html:8
msgid "Supprimer mon compte"
msgstr "Delete my account"

#: templates/accounts/activate.html:4 templates/accounts/activate.html:8
msgid "Activer votre compte"
msgstr "Activate your account"

#: templates/accounts/activate.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "Compte associé à l’adresse %(email)s."
msgstr "Account linked to the address %(email)s."

#: templates/accounts/activate.html:14
msgid "Activer mon compte"
msgstr "Activate my account"

#: templates/accounts/activation_invalid.html:4
#: templates/accounts/activation_invalid.html:8
msgid "Lien d’activation non valide"
msgstr "Invalid activation link"

#: templates/accounts/activation_invalid.html:9
msgid ""
"Ce lien a déjà servi, a expiré ou est incomplet. Si votre compte est activé, "
"connectez-vous ; sinon, inscrivez-vous à nouveau avec la même adresse pour "
"recevoir un nouveau lien."
msgstr ""
"This link has already been used, has expired or is incomplete. If your "
"account is active, log in; otherwise, sign up again with the same address to "
"receive a new link."

#: templates/accounts/activation_invalid.html:14
#: templates/accounts/login.html:13
#: templates/accounts/password_reset_complete.html:9
msgid "Se connecter"
msgstr "Log in"

#: templates/accounts/activation_invalid.html:15
#: templates/accounts/login.html:17 templates/accounts/signup.html:4
#: templates/accounts/signup.html:8
msgid "Créer un compte"
msgstr "Create an account"

#: templates/accounts/delete.html:9
msgid ""
"Votre nom, votre adresse e-mail et votre ORCID seront effacés, et vous ne "
"pourrez plus vous connecter. Vos contributions, publiées sous licence CC BY-"
"SA 4.0, restent en ligne et sont attribuées à un contributeur anonyme. Cette "
"action est définitive."
msgstr ""
"Your name, email address and ORCID iD will be erased, and you will no longer "
"be able to log in. Your contributions, published under the CC BY-SA 4.0 "
"license, stay online and are credited to an anonymous contributor. This "
"cannot be undone."

#: templates/accounts/delete.html:17
msgid "Supprimer définitivement"
msgstr "Delete permanently"

#: templates/accounts/delete.html:19 templates/accounts/password_change.html:14
msgid "Annuler"
msgstr "Cancel"

#: templates/accounts/email/activation_body.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "Bonjour %(name)s,"
msgstr "Hello %(name)s,"

#: templates/accounts/email/activation_body.txt:3
msgid "Pour activer votre compte, ouvrez ce lien :"
msgstr "To activate your account, open this link:"

#: templates/accounts/email/activation_body.txt:7
msgid ""
"Le lien reste valable trois jours. Si vous n’êtes pas à l’origine de cette "
"inscription, ignorez ce message : le compte ne sera pas activé."
msgstr ""
"The link is valid for three days. If you did not sign up, ignore this "
"message: the account will not be activated."

#: templates/accounts/email/activation_subject.txt:1
msgid "Activez votre compte"
msgstr "Activate your account"

#: templates/accounts/email/activation_subject.txt:1
#: templates/accounts/email/password_reset_subject.txt:1 templates/base.html:6
#: templates/base.html:11
msgid "Phraséologie latine"
msgstr "Latin Phraseology"

#: templates/accounts/email/password_reset_body.txt:1
msgid "Bonjour,"
msgstr "Hello,"

#: templates/accounts/email/password_reset_body.txt:3
msgid "Pour choisir un nouveau mot de passe, ouvrez ce lien :"
msgstr "To choose a new password, open this link:"

#: templates/accounts/email/password_reset_body.txt:7
msgid ""
"Le lien reste valable trois jours. Si vous n’avez rien demandé, ignorez ce "
"message : votre mot de passe ne change pas."
msgstr ""
"The link is valid for three days. If you did not ask for it, ignore this "
"message: your password stays the same."

#: templates/accounts/email/password_reset_subject.txt:1
#: templates/accounts/password_reset_confirm.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_reset_confirm.html:8
msgid "Nouveau mot de passe"
msgstr "New password"

#: templates/accounts/login.html:4 templates/accounts/login.html:8
#: templates/base.html:21
msgid "Connexion"
msgstr "Log in"

#: templates/accounts/login.html:16
msgid "Mot de passe oublié ?"
msgstr "Forgotten your password?"

#: templates/accounts/password_change.html:12
msgid "Changer le mot de passe"
msgstr "Change the password"

#: templates/accounts/password_change_done.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_change_done.html:8
msgid "Mot de passe modifié"
msgstr "Password changed"

#: templates/accounts/password_change_done.html:9
msgid "Retour à mon compte"
msgstr "Back to my account"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_reset.html:8
msgid "Mot de passe oublié"
msgstr "Forgotten password"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset.html:9
msgid ""
"Indiquez l’adresse e-mail de votre compte : vous recevrez un lien pour "
"choisir un nouveau mot de passe."
msgstr ""
"Enter the email address of your account: you will receive a link to choose a "
"new password."

#: templates/accounts/password_reset.html:16
msgid "Envoyer le lien"
msgstr "Send the link"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_complete.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_reset_complete.html:8
msgid "Mot de passe enregistré"
msgstr "Password saved"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_confirm.html:13
msgid "Enregistrer le mot de passe"
msgstr "Save the password"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_confirm.html:16
msgid "Ce lien a déjà servi ou a expiré."
msgstr "This link has already been used or has expired."

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_confirm.html:17
msgid "Demander un nouveau lien"
msgstr "Ask for a new link"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_done.html:4
#: templates/accounts/password_reset_done.html:8
#: templates/accounts/signup_done.html:4 templates/accounts/signup_done.html:8
msgid "Vérifiez votre boîte e-mail"
msgstr "Check your inbox"

#: templates/accounts/password_reset_done.html:9
msgid ""
"Si un compte existe avec cette adresse, un e-mail vient de partir. Suivez le "
"lien qu’il contient ; il reste valable trois jours."
msgstr ""
"If an account exists with this address, an email is on its way. Follow the "
"link it contains; it is valid for three days."

#: templates/accounts/profile.html:8
msgid "Page de contributeur"
msgstr "Contributor page"

#: templates/accounts/profile.html:18
msgid "Membre depuis"
msgstr "Member since"

#: templates/accounts/profile.html:28
msgid "Les contributions apparaîtront ici."
msgstr "Contributions will appear here."

#: templates/accounts/signup.html:9
msgid ""
"L’inscription est libre et réservée aux personnes majeures. Nous demandons "
"seulement une adresse e-mail, pour activer le compte, et un nom affiché sur "
"vos contributions."
msgstr ""
"Anyone aged 18 or over can sign up. We only ask for an email address, to "
"activate the account, and a name shown on your contributions."

#: templates/accounts/signup.html:16
msgid "Créer mon compte"
msgstr "Create my account"

#: templates/accounts/signup.html:18
msgid ""
"Vos contributions sont publiées sous licence CC BY-SA 4.0. Si vous supprimez "
"votre compte, elles restent en ligne, sans votre nom."
msgstr ""
"Your contributions are published under the CC BY-SA 4.0 license. If you "
"delete your account, they stay online, without your name."

#: templates/accounts/signup.html:23
msgid "Vous avez déjà un compte ? Se connecter"
msgstr "Already have an account? Log in"

#: templates/accounts/signup_done.html:9
msgid ""
"Un e-mail vient de vous être envoyé. Suivez le lien qu’il contient pour "
"activer votre compte ; il reste valable trois jours."
msgstr ""
"An email has just been sent to you. Follow the link it contains to activate "
"your account; it is valid for three days."

#: templates/accounts/signup_done.html:13
msgid ""
"Rien reçu ? Regardez dans les courriers indésirables, ou inscrivez-vous à "
"nouveau avec la même adresse : un nouveau lien vous sera envoyé."
msgstr ""
"Nothing received? Check your spam folder, or sign up again with the same "
"address: a new link will be sent to you."

#: templates/base.html:13
msgid "Compte"
msgstr "Account"

#: templates/base.html:18
msgid "Déconnexion"
msgstr "Log out"

#: templates/base.html:22
msgid "Inscription"
msgstr "Sign up"

#: templates/base.html:28
msgid "Langue"
msgstr "Language"

#: templates/base.html:35
msgid "Changer"
msgstr "Change"

#: templates/base.html:52
msgid "Code sous licence AGPL-3.0 · contributions sous licence CC BY-SA 4.0"
msgstr "Code under AGPL-3.0 · contributions under CC BY-SA 4.0"

#: templates/core/home.html:6
msgid "En construction"
msgstr "Under construction"

#: templates/core/home.html:7
msgid "Traduire en latin, preuves à l’appui"
msgstr "Translating into Latin, with evidence"

#: templates/core/home.html:8
msgid ""
"Une plateforme collaborative pour traduire vers le latin, relever la "
"phraséologie des auteurs et justifier chaque choix par le corpus."
msgstr ""
"A collaborative platform to translate into Latin, collect the phraseology of "
"classical authors and back every choice with the corpus."

#: templates/core/home.html:15
msgid "Trois buts liés"
msgstr "Three connected goals"

#: templates/core/home.html:18
msgid "Traduire"
msgstr "Translate"

#: templates/core/home.html:19
msgid ""
"Chacun rédige sa version latine d’un texte, puis on compare les versions "
"phrase par phrase."
msgstr ""
"Everyone writes their own Latin version of a text, then the versions are "
"compared sentence by sentence."

#: templates/core/home.html:24
msgid "Relever"
msgstr "Collect"

#: templates/core/home.html:25
msgid ""
"Les tournures des auteurs, de <i>consilium capere</i> à <i>quid multa?</i>, "
"sont réunies en fiches attestées dans le corpus."
msgstr ""
"Authors’ expressions, from <i>consilium capere</i> to <i>quid multa?</i>, "
"are gathered into entries attested in the corpus."

#: templates/core/home.html:31
msgid "Justifier"
msgstr "Justify"

#: templates/core/home.html:32
msgid ""
"Chaque choix de traduction peut s’appuyer sur des passages d’auteurs, une "
"règle de grammaire ou un article de dictionnaire."
msgstr ""
"Every translation choice can rest on passages from authors, a grammar rule "
"or a dictionary entry."

#: templates/core/home.html:38
msgid ""
"Corpus de départ : Cicéron, César, Salluste, Tite-Live, Sénèque, Pline le "
"Jeune."
msgstr ""
"Starting corpus: Cicero, Caesar, Sallust, Livy, Seneca, Pliny the Younger."
